msgid "Update"
msgstr "Mise à jour"

msgid "Read the [release notes](../release-notes.md) of the new version."
msgstr "Lisez les [notes de version](../release-notes.md) de la nouvelle version."

msgid "[Back up](backup.md) `/data`."
msgstr "[Sauvegardez](backup.md) `/data`."

msgid "Change the tag (and digest) in `compose.yaml`, [verify the new image](../security/verify-image.md), then:"
msgstr "Changez l'étiquette (et le condensat) dans `compose.yaml`, [vérifiez la nouvelle image](../security/verify-image.md), puis :"

msgid "Migrations run at start. Going back to an older version after its migrations have run needs the backup."
msgstr "Les migrations s'exécutent au démarrage. Revenir à une version plus ancienne après l'exécution de ses migrations demande la sauvegarde."

msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Étiquettes"

msgid "Tag"
msgstr "Étiquette"

msgid "Points to"
msgstr "Désigne"

msgid "`X.Y.Z`"
msgstr "`X.Y.Z`"

msgid "A release."
msgstr "Une version."

msgid "`X.Y`"
msgstr "`X.Y`"

msgid "The most recently published `X.Y.*` release."
msgstr "La dernière version publiée de `X.Y.*`."

msgid "`latest`"
msgstr "`latest`"

msgid "The most recently published release (never a pre-release)."
msgstr "La dernière version publiée (jamais une préversion)."

msgid "`X.Y.Z-rc.N`"
msgstr "`X.Y.Z-rc.N`"

msgid "A pre-release."
msgstr "Une préversion."

msgid "`edge`"
msgstr "`edge`"

msgid "The latest commit on `main`: for testing, not for production."
msgstr "Le dernier commit de `main` : pour tester, pas pour la production."

msgid "`sha-<commit>`"
msgstr "`sha-<commit>`"

msgid "The image built from that commit."
msgstr "L'image construite à partir de ce commit."

msgid "Pin a version and its digest in production; a tag can move, a digest cannot."
msgstr "En production, fixez une version et son condensat ; une étiquette peut bouger, un condensat jamais."

